Wed Sep  2 12:07:59 UTC 2026 - Felix Prasse <felix.prasse@suse.com>

- Upgrade to version 0.20.1:
  * Users explicitly enabling or disabling the
    replication_slot collector must update their flags:
    * `--collector.replication_slot`
       -> `--collector.replication_slots`
    * `--no-collector.replication_slot`
       -> `--no-collector.replication_slots`
  * `--disable-settings-metrics` flag was removed
  * PG_EXPORTER_DISABLE_SETTINGS_METRICS env var
    was replaced with the --no-collector.settings flag
  * `replication_slot` collector has been renamed
     to `replication_slots`
  * metric names changed:
    * `pg_replication_slot_slot_current_wal_lsn`
       -> `pg_replication_slots_slot_current_wal_lsn`
    * `pg_replication_slot_slot_confirmed_flush_lsn`
       -> `pg_replication_slots_slot_confirmed_flush_lsn`
    * `pg_replication_slot_slot_is_active`
       -> `pg_replication_slots_slot_is_active`
    * `pg_replication_slot_safe_wal_size_bytes`
       -> `pg_replication_slots_safe_wal_size_bytes`
    * `pg_replication_slot_wal_status`
       -> `pg_replication_slots_wal_status`

- Upgrade to version 0.19.0:
  * Allow setting `limit` in `pg_stat_statements` collector 
  * Allow excluding databases or users names in
    `stat_statements` collector

- Upgrade to version 0.18.0:
  * Add `stat_progress_vacuum`, `buffercache_summary` collectors
  * Add `buffercache_summary` collector
  
- Upgrade to version 0.17.0:
  * Export last replay age in replication collector

- Upgrade to version 0.16.0:
  * Logging format changed
  * Add save_wal_size and wal_status to replication_slot collector
  * Add roles collector and connection limit metrics to
    database collector
  * Add active_time to stat_database collector
  * Add slot_type label to replication_slot collector

- Upgrade to version 0.15.0:
  * Add support for 1kB and 2kB units
	
- Upgrade to version v0.14.0:
  * Add `state` label to pg_process_idle_seconds #862
  * Add collectors:
    * wal
    * database_wraparound
    * stat_activity_autovacuum
    * stat_wal_receiver
    * xlog_location
    * statio_user_indexes
    * long_running_transactions
  * Add metric pg_stat_user_tables_size_bytes

- Upgrade to version 0.13.0:
  * Deprecate additional database features
    (auto-discover-databases,extend.query-path,
    constantLabels, exclude-databases, include-databases)
  * Supports alternate postgres:// prefix in URLs

- Upgrade to version 0.12.1:
  * Fix column type for pg_replication_slots

- Upgrade to version 0.12.0:
  * Add multi-target support
  * Add replication metrics from pg_replication_slots

- Upgrade to version 0.11.1:
  * Fix checkpoint_write_time value type
  * Fix checkpoint_sync_time value type

- Upgrade to version 0.11.0:
  * Add pg_database collector
  * Add pg_database_size_bytes metric
  * pg_stat_bgwriter counter metrics had the `_total` suffix added

